        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Brass Accents Decorative Nantucket Pull Plate 3-3/4\" Wide x 13-7/8\" High</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis decorative Nantucket pull plate is from the new Brass Accents Renaissance Collection. Highly detailed genuine recreation of the popular Roman style original from Russell & Erwin Hardware, 1909. The decorative design door pull plate was very popular in churches and high end homes in europe. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance, hand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of decorative hot-forged  and cast brass door hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <b>Matching <a href=\"/products/nantucket-solid-brass-push-plate-brass-accents-a04-p7200\">Decorative Nantucket Push Plate</a>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for  Brass Accents A04-P7201 Decorative Nantucket Pull Plate\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Plate Width: 3-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Plate Height: 13-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Length: 6-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Cast Brass</li>\r\n<li><b>Finish Warranty: 10 Years</b></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nComes complete with matching finish mounting screws for easy installation. Hand rubbed and finished in the USA with a 10 year warranty.\r\n</p>",
